     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Calculating Thresholds\n<br>======================\n<br>Calculating thresholds for image expression patterns is tricky, even \n<br>when the data do not show any spatial inhomogoneity (typically in Z). I \n<br>have some examples here of functions that I have previously used to try \n<br>and fit the distribution of background pixel intensities in order to \n<br>come up with a sensible threshold estimate:\n<br>\n<br><a href=\"https://github.com/jefferis/AnalysisSuite/blob/master/R/Code/Image/ImageAnalysisFunctions.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jefferis/AnalysisSuite/blob/master/R/Code/Image/ImageAnalysisFunctions.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485887067000&amp;usg=AOvVaw06mjP21z1gO8blIFGVaNmV\">https://github.com/jefferis/AnalysisSuite/blob/master/R/Code/Image/ImageAnalysisFunctions.R</a>\n<br>\n<br>You can see a full example of using this (on the Janelia GMR lines) \n<br>here:\n<br>\n<br><a href=\"https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/tree/master/src/ImagePostprocessing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/tree/master/src/ImagePostprocessing&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485887067000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1clrHsnwAmSJBdg0ltEtDO\">https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/tree/master/src/ImagePostprocessing</a>\n<br><a href=\"https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/blob/master/src/ImagePostprocessing/CalculateBackgroundParams.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/blob/master/src/ImagePostprocessing/CalculateBackgroundParams.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485887067000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2VWGQsICKKuKxYaEwEUprp\">https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/blob/master/src/ImagePostprocessing/CalculateBackgroundParams.R</a>\n<br><a href=\"https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/blob/master/src/ImagePostprocessing/CalculateHistograms.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/blob/master/src/ImagePostprocessing/CalculateHistograms.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485887067000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Seax6Xhdq6_kKgDFjpaoV\">https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/blob/master/src/ImagePostprocessing/CalculateHistograms.R</a>\n<br>\n<br>but more usefully for right now, you can just fetch the background \n<br>parameters directly\n<br>\n<br><a href=\"https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/blob/master/db/jfrc2bparams.rda?raw=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/blob/master/db/jfrc2bparams.rda?raw%3Dtrue&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485887067000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2tbTtzCvpA_udnA8VAk8tR\">https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/blob/master/db/jfrc2bparams.rda?raw=true</a>\n<br>\n<br>you can load in R like this:\n<br>\n<br><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div> <span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\"># curl add on package required for reading from https url</span></div></blockquote><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">library(curl)</font></font><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\"> </span></blockquote><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">\n</font><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">load(curl(&quot;<a href=\"https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/blob/master/db/jfrc2bparams.rda?raw=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/blob/master/db/jfrc2bparams.rda?raw%3Dtrue&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485887067000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2tbTtzCvpA_udnA8VAk8tR\">https://github.com/jefferislab/FlyLight/blob/master/db/jfrc2bparams.rda?raw=true</a>&quot;))\n<br></font><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">str(jfrc2bparams)<br>\n</font><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">hist(jfrc2bparams$threshold)<br>\n</font><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># find threshold for line 9A03<br>\n</font><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">jfrc2bparams$threshold[grep(&#39;GMR_9A03&#39;,jfrc2bparams$filestem)]\n</font></font></blockquote>\n<br>Best,\n<br>\n<br>Greg.\n<br>\n<br>--\n<br>Gregory Jefferis, PhD                   Tel: <a href=\"tel:+44%201223%20267048\" value=\"+441223267048\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 1223 267048</a>\n<br>Division of Neurobiology\n<br>MRC Laboratory of Molecular Biology\n<br>Francis Crick Avenue\n<br>Cambridge Biomedical Campus\n<br>Cambridge, CB2 OQH, UK\n<br>\n<br><a href=\"http://www2.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/group-leaders/h-to-m/g-jefferis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www2.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/group-leaders/h-to-m/g-jefferis&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485887067000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1iQWXoXXeIaMB8t2eHsqnr\">http://www2.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/group-leaders/h-to-m/g-jefferis</a>\n<br><a href=\"http://jefferislab.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jefferislab.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485887067000&amp;usg=AOvVaw013sTxUtk7SZbFcf28bJ2Y\">http://jefferislab.org</a>\n<br><a href=\"http://flybrain.stanford.edu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.stanford.edu&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485887067000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3EMikGpNrqrkAXb2ZbuEj1\">http://flybrain.stanford.edu</a>\n<br></div>"
